WEBVTT

1
00:00:05.766 --> 00:00:08.766
After battling his way to the Kalos League finals,

2
00:00:08.833 --> 00:00:12.200
Ash is now in the midst of a battle against Alain,

3
00:00:12.266 --> 00:00:14.833
his talented and formidable opponent.

4
00:00:17.966 --> 00:00:20.300
Pikachu!

5
00:00:21.333 --> 00:00:23.366
Thunderbolt is super effective,

6
00:00:23.433 --> 00:00:25.666
but Charizard is still standing!

7
00:00:25.733 --> 00:00:28.133
All right, Pikachu, use quick attack!

8
00:00:30.200 --> 00:00:31.533
Use flamethrower!

9
00:00:34.933 --> 00:00:35.766
Pika!

10
00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:37.833
Pikachu!

11
00:00:38.633 --> 00:00:40.666
Uh-oh. Pikachu isn't moving.

12
00:00:41.433 --> 00:00:43.433
I hope Pikachu's all right.

13
00:00:44.333 --> 00:00:46.500
Its last battle wore Pikachu out.

14
00:00:46.933 --> 00:00:48.233
Charizard, fly up!

15
00:00:49.933 --> 00:00:51.366
Get up! Pikachu!

16
00:00:53.400 --> 00:00:54.933
Use flamethrower!

17
00:00:56.800 --> 00:00:59.866
Now, use iron tail and aim it towards the ground!

18
00:01:05.500 --> 00:01:06.733
That was impressive.

19
00:01:06.900 --> 00:01:07.900
Use dragon claw!

20
00:01:07.966 --> 00:01:09.300
Use iron tail!

21
00:01:15.200 --> 00:01:16.166
Pikachu!

22
00:01:18.733 --> 00:01:21.933
Pikachu is unable to battle! Charizard's the winner!

23
00:01:23.333 --> 00:01:25.666
That's it! Pikachu is defeated!

24
00:01:25.733 --> 00:01:28.866
Now both trainers have two Pokémon left!

25
00:01:28.933 --> 00:01:30.366
Are you okay, Pikachu?

26
00:01:31.866 --> 00:01:34.300
Thanks so much. You were just awesome.

27
00:01:34.533 --> 00:01:36.166
Now leave the rest to us.

28
00:01:41.366 --> 00:01:43.366
Oh, we're just getting warmed up.

29
00:01:48.933 --> 00:01:52.533
♪ I stand tall 'Cause I know I'm a winner ♪

30
00:01:52.600 --> 00:01:56.133
♪ Knock me down I'll just get up again ♪

31
00:01:56.700 --> 00:01:59.600
♪ You've met your match Yeah, I'm no beginner ♪

32
00:01:59.666 --> 00:02:02.800
♪ Pokémon, Pokémon ♪

33
00:02:02.866 --> 00:02:04.533
♪ Gotta catch 'em all ♪

34
00:02:04.600 --> 00:02:07.766
♪ I stand tall 'Cause I know I'm a winner ♪

35
00:02:07.833 --> 00:02:10.933
♪ Pokémon, Pokémon ♪

36
00:02:11.000 --> 00:02:12.600
♪ Gotta catch 'em all ♪

37
00:02:23.533 --> 00:02:26.933
Hi. Here is an update from the Kalos League finals.

38
00:02:27.233 --> 00:02:30.233
Alain's Charizard has beaten Ash's Pikachu.

39
00:02:30.300 --> 00:02:32.400
Come on, what is Pikachu doing?

40
00:02:32.466 --> 00:02:35.133
Stomping all over our feelings, that's what.

41
00:02:35.200 --> 00:02:37.966
Since when are you two cheering for the twerp?

42
00:02:38.033 --> 00:02:40.233
Since we decided we don't like this.

43
00:02:40.600 --> 00:02:42.733
The twerp's our rival, not his.

44
00:02:42.800 --> 00:02:45.666
If he loses to anybody, it'll be us, not him.

45
00:02:48.333 --> 00:02:50.800
From now on, we're the twerp's cheerleaders.

46
00:02:52.533 --> 00:02:56.400
I can't believe it. Pikachu worked so hard, but it lost.

47
00:02:57.266 --> 00:03:00.433
Alain's last Pokémon are Charizard and Bisharp.

48
00:03:00.733 --> 00:03:04.766
Remember, Alain's last two Pokémon have been battling really hard.

49
00:03:05.266 --> 00:03:09.866
On the other hand, Ash's last two Pokémon haven't even been in a battle yet.

50
00:03:09.933 --> 00:03:12.133
You could say Ash has the advantage.

51
00:03:12.300 --> 00:03:16.000
Yeah. He'll be fine. When I see Ash grinning like that...

52
00:03:16.566 --> 00:03:18.000
I just know it.

53
00:03:22.633 --> 00:03:24.466
Come on, you can do it, Alain.

54
00:03:24.900 --> 00:03:26.733
Goodra, I choose you!

55
00:03:28.766 --> 00:03:30.233
Goodra.

56
00:03:30.666 --> 00:03:31.733
Charizard, return.

57
00:03:32.800 --> 00:03:35.633
And Charizard's out of the action.

58
00:03:38.366 --> 00:03:39.600
Bisharp, let's go!

59
00:03:43.933 --> 00:03:48.066
There they are! Ash is using Goodra, and Alain is using Bisharp!

60
00:03:48.833 --> 00:03:51.033
First, we'll fix up the battlefield.

61
00:03:51.266 --> 00:03:52.433
Use rain dance!

62
00:03:57.600 --> 00:04:00.066
And now Goodra's making it rain!

63
00:04:00.133 --> 00:04:01.766
All right, use ice beam!

64
00:04:03.766 --> 00:04:05.900
Dodge it and then use iron head!

65
00:04:07.700 --> 00:04:08.833
Block it!

66
00:04:11.100 --> 00:04:12.766
Okay, throw it, Goodra!

67
00:04:15.366 --> 00:04:16.800
Use dragon pulse!

68
00:04:19.466 --> 00:04:20.300
Focus blast!

69
00:04:26.766 --> 00:04:28.200
Iron head, let's go!

70
00:04:29.700 --> 00:04:30.766
Use bide!

71
00:04:34.033 --> 00:04:35.900
Goodra, are you all right?

72
00:04:37.800 --> 00:04:38.966
Focus blast!

73
00:04:44.400 --> 00:04:46.033
Goodra's hanging in!

74
00:04:46.100 --> 00:04:49.333
Will Ash's strategy turn out to be the best one going

75
00:04:49.400 --> 00:04:51.166
between our two competitors?

76
00:04:51.600 --> 00:04:53.766
Go around it! Then iron head!

77
00:04:58.033 --> 00:04:58.933
Use bide!

78
00:05:06.300 --> 00:05:07.800
Bisharp, are you okay?

79
00:05:08.800 --> 00:05:13.500
Ash unleashes a counterattack, and Goodra overpowers Bisharp!

80
00:05:16.866 --> 00:05:20.666
Well done, Goodra, for enduring those unbelievable attacks!

81
00:05:20.866 --> 00:05:22.966
This sure is an exciting battle.

82
00:05:23.500 --> 00:05:26.566
I wish I could have somehow made it to the stadium.

83
00:05:27.000 --> 00:05:29.900
- You, Clembot?
- I'm right with you on that.

84
00:05:30.800 --> 00:05:32.133
Iron head, go!

85
00:05:39.800 --> 00:05:42.900
- Oh, no. Goodra!
- That was a potent strike!

86
00:05:42.966 --> 00:05:45.733
- Could be trouble for Goodra.
- Use guillotine!

87
00:05:47.066 --> 00:05:49.700
Come on, Goodra, dragon pulse, let's go!

88
00:06:04.466 --> 00:06:06.300
- Oh, uh!
- Pika!

89
00:06:07.033 --> 00:06:08.800
Goodra is unable to battle!

90
00:06:09.100 --> 00:06:10.700
Bisharp's the winner!

91
00:06:11.800 --> 00:06:14.733
Bisharp has defeated Goodra!

92
00:06:15.200 --> 00:06:18.633
- I feel so bad for Goodra.
- One Pokémon left.

93
00:06:18.700 --> 00:06:21.400
Which means Ash is down to his last chance.

94
00:06:22.666 --> 00:06:23.800
Good luck, Ash.

95
00:06:25.700 --> 00:06:27.566
Thanks, Goodra. You were great.

96
00:06:29.566 --> 00:06:31.033
Let's win this together.

97
00:06:31.366 --> 00:06:32.733
Go, Greninja!

98
00:06:38.266 --> 00:06:41.100
So, Ash has finally brought out his Greninja.

99
00:06:41.533 --> 00:06:44.966
Greninja will be Ash's final Pokémon of the Kalos League.

100
00:06:45.033 --> 00:06:47.666
- If they lose...
- Who does she think she is,

101
00:06:47.733 --> 00:06:49.900
talking like Greninja's gonna lose?

102
00:06:50.333 --> 00:06:53.466
Come on. Chill. The more the twerp's under pressure,

103
00:06:53.533 --> 00:06:56.033
the more the twerp will beat Alain.

104
00:06:56.100 --> 00:06:57.666
Correct. After all...

105
00:06:58.333 --> 00:07:00.400
We're the ones who whipped him into shape!

106
00:07:03.533 --> 00:07:06.466
Now! Bisharp, give it everything you've got!

107
00:07:08.966 --> 00:07:10.366
Let's do it, Greninja!

108
00:07:12.466 --> 00:07:13.766
Use iron head!

109
00:07:15.700 --> 00:07:17.066
Now, double team!

110
00:07:20.700 --> 00:07:21.633
Water shuriken!

111
00:07:33.033 --> 00:07:33.866
Bisharp!

112
00:07:36.833 --> 00:07:39.933
Bisharp is unable to battle! Greninja's the winner!

113
00:07:40.366 --> 00:07:41.333
All right!

114
00:07:42.866 --> 00:07:44.233
- They won!
- They won!

115
00:07:46.033 --> 00:07:47.566
That's it! The rain!

116
00:07:48.266 --> 00:07:52.600
- What are you talking about?
- Rainy weather powers up water-type moves.

117
00:07:52.833 --> 00:07:57.066
Wow. Goodra's lingering rain dance is helping Greninja. Good call.

118
00:07:58.200 --> 00:08:00.133
It's a relay with Goodra.

119
00:08:00.566 --> 00:08:02.633
It's a true group victory.

120
00:08:02.700 --> 00:08:04.933
Charizard, let's go!

121
00:08:10.433 --> 00:08:12.400
Here comes Charizard!

122
00:08:12.466 --> 00:08:15.066
Both trainers are using their last Pokémon!

123
00:08:15.133 --> 00:08:18.000
This will be the deciding battle!

124
00:08:21.966 --> 00:08:25.033
Charizard, it's the battle we've been waiting for.

125
00:08:25.666 --> 00:08:27.300
Let's enjoy it all the way.

126
00:08:29.466 --> 00:08:33.000
Know what, Greninja? We couldn't ask for a better opponent.

127
00:08:33.233 --> 00:08:35.366
Let's give them 100 percent!

128
00:08:36.166 --> 00:08:37.766
Okay, Greninja, run!

129
00:08:38.833 --> 00:08:40.066
Go, Charizard!

130
00:08:42.333 --> 00:08:43.633
Use flamethrower!

131
00:08:45.300 --> 00:08:46.400
Dodge it, quick!

132
00:08:48.033 --> 00:08:49.933
Now, Greninja, use cut!

133
00:08:54.400 --> 00:08:56.366
Greninja nails that cut!

134
00:08:56.433 --> 00:08:58.500
Charizard's definitely feeling it.

135
00:09:00.566 --> 00:09:02.366
The rain stopped.

136
00:09:02.766 --> 00:09:04.933
How will it affect this battle?

137
00:09:05.533 --> 00:09:08.300
That's all for Goodra's rain dance assistance.

138
00:09:08.366 --> 00:09:11.166
Still, Greninja has the type advantage.

139
00:09:11.600 --> 00:09:12.633
It'll be fine.

140
00:09:12.800 --> 00:09:14.400
Ash will definitely win.

141
00:09:14.833 --> 00:09:16.666
Let's show them how, Greninja.

142
00:09:18.066 --> 00:09:19.100
Alain, I--

143
00:09:19.400 --> 00:09:20.733
We're not gonna lose.

144
00:09:20.800 --> 00:09:24.166
We're putting everything we have into this. Count on it.

145
00:09:27.233 --> 00:09:28.200
Greninja!

146
00:09:42.300 --> 00:09:44.433
There it is! It's Ash-Greninja!

147
00:09:46.066 --> 00:09:47.266
This is marvelous.

148
00:09:53.233 --> 00:09:57.333
Thanks, Ash. I was waiting for you to give me a full-power battle.

149
00:09:57.733 --> 00:10:00.833
Now, lift me to an even higher level of battling.

150
00:10:01.266 --> 00:10:03.333
Okay, then, this is it.

151
00:10:04.300 --> 00:10:06.933
All right, respond to my heart, Key Stone!

152
00:10:07.300 --> 00:10:08.566
Beyond Evolution!

153
00:10:08.933 --> 00:10:10.166
Mega Evolve!

154
00:10:27.900 --> 00:10:30.933
Oh, please, Charizard. Help Alain win this.

155
00:10:31.700 --> 00:10:35.700
Fantastic! Alain's Charizard has Mega Evolved!

156
00:10:35.766 --> 00:10:39.933
And this battle will decide who will be the Kalos League winner!

157
00:10:40.566 --> 00:10:42.466
Who's that Pokémon?

158
00:10:47.000 --> 00:10:48.666
It's Bisharp!

159
00:10:53.700 --> 00:10:55.233
Run, Greninja! Go!

160
00:10:58.600 --> 00:10:59.733
Use double team!

161
00:11:01.100 --> 00:11:03.433
Flamethrower! Get rid of the fakes!

162
00:11:05.966 --> 00:11:07.666
Now use water shuriken!

163
00:11:11.133 --> 00:11:12.833
All right, dragon claw!

164
00:11:16.666 --> 00:11:17.800
Aerial ace!

165
00:11:18.266 --> 00:11:19.433
Dragon claw!

166
00:11:32.533 --> 00:11:33.833
Flamethrower, go!

167
00:11:36.400 --> 00:11:37.333
Cut, let's go!

168
00:11:43.000 --> 00:11:44.333
Now, blast burn!

169
00:11:49.266 --> 00:11:52.066
All right, water shuriken, at the ground!

170
00:11:57.300 --> 00:12:00.433
They stopped that blast burn with a water shuriken!

171
00:12:00.500 --> 00:12:03.200
I've never seen a battle like this before!

172
00:12:03.266 --> 00:12:04.666
Aerial ace!

173
00:12:10.366 --> 00:12:11.733
Go, go, go, Ash!

174
00:12:11.800 --> 00:12:13.133
Go, go, Greninja!

175
00:12:14.633 --> 00:12:16.100
Are you okay, Charizard?

176
00:12:22.400 --> 00:12:24.966
Alain sure is enjoying his battle with Ash.

177
00:12:29.400 --> 00:12:30.233
Thanks, Ash.

178
00:12:30.866 --> 00:12:34.466
It's because of you that I'm finally having fun. Lots of it.

179
00:12:34.566 --> 00:12:38.600
I'm having more fun battling you than I've had in such a long time.

180
00:12:39.033 --> 00:12:41.700
I'm grateful to you for letting me feel this.

181
00:12:42.200 --> 00:12:43.033
However...

182
00:12:43.966 --> 00:12:45.866
I have to be the strongest one.

183
00:12:46.300 --> 00:12:48.100
I can't lose to anyone again!

184
00:12:48.866 --> 00:12:51.000
Charizard! Use dragon claw!

185
00:12:59.166 --> 00:13:02.066
- Powerful.
- They're still hanging in there.

186
00:13:05.633 --> 00:13:08.433
I'm having an awesome time being able to battle

187
00:13:08.500 --> 00:13:12.300
such a strong trainer like you. But this is gonna be over soon.

188
00:13:13.333 --> 00:13:15.900
Whoever wins, no hard feelings, okay?

189
00:13:16.200 --> 00:13:17.300
So, look out...

190
00:13:17.533 --> 00:13:19.466
for a full-powered attack!

191
00:13:19.733 --> 00:13:21.333
Greninja, use cut!

192
00:13:23.766 --> 00:13:25.233
Charizard, dragon claw!

193
00:13:38.633 --> 00:13:40.333
- Water shuriken!
- Use thunder punch!

194
00:13:45.166 --> 00:13:47.366
Greninja's blocking thunder punch

195
00:13:47.433 --> 00:13:50.000
with a water shuriken! Such intense combat!

196
00:13:59.433 --> 00:14:00.766
Ready for more?

197
00:14:01.000 --> 00:14:02.100
Water shuriken!

198
00:14:08.366 --> 00:14:09.833
Now, blast burn!

199
00:14:48.000 --> 00:14:49.466
Pika.

200
00:14:49.533 --> 00:14:53.566
Greninja's unable to battle! Charizard wins! Alain is the champion!

201
00:14:56.400 --> 00:15:01.833
It's over! After multiple fierce battles during the Kalos League's final round,

202
00:15:01.900 --> 00:15:04.233
Alain clinches it bigtime!

203
00:15:11.500 --> 00:15:12.566
They're strong.

204
00:15:12.900 --> 00:15:15.500
- Wow!
- Pika.

205
00:15:15.600 --> 00:15:17.233
Poor Ash lost.

206
00:15:18.133 --> 00:15:21.533
- What a crying shame.
- And the battle was so close, too.

207
00:15:22.033 --> 00:15:24.233
- It was a great one, though.
- Right.

208
00:15:24.533 --> 00:15:26.766
It was a very Ash-like battle, too.

209
00:15:27.200 --> 00:15:29.000
Ash has a smile on his face.

210
00:15:29.533 --> 00:15:34.200
Of course, he's proud. He gave that battle everything he possibly could.

211
00:15:35.233 --> 00:15:37.300
Great job, Greninja. Thanks.

212
00:15:38.533 --> 00:15:42.766
Don't be sorry. I'm grateful to have a team as strong as you guys.

213
00:15:43.533 --> 00:15:44.800
Pika.

214
00:15:45.066 --> 00:15:47.366
Ash, thank you very much.

215
00:15:47.766 --> 00:15:52.100
Thanks to you, too. Our battle was just about as fun as it could get.

216
00:16:00.300 --> 00:16:02.966
This battle really has no winner or loser.

217
00:16:03.433 --> 00:16:07.000
What it has are the joyous faces of two trainers, smiling

218
00:16:07.066 --> 00:16:08.966
after a hard-fought match.

219
00:16:10.766 --> 00:16:13.633
I am completely beside myself with awe.

220
00:16:13.700 --> 00:16:15.900
That battle was the genuine article.

221
00:16:15.966 --> 00:16:18.033
Who cares about beating twerps?

222
00:16:18.100 --> 00:16:19.933
All I care about is now.

223
00:16:24.066 --> 00:16:26.733
Alain, you were awesome. You should be proud.

224
00:16:29.800 --> 00:16:33.966
Alain, I hope you were you able to find what you've been looking for.

225
00:16:35.166 --> 00:16:39.133
Ash, that was a truly spectacular battle. I couldn't believe it.

226
00:16:39.566 --> 00:16:42.833
Thanks, Tierno. I'm sorry if I let you all down.

227
00:16:42.900 --> 00:16:46.333
Stop. We all know you did the best you could possibly do.

228
00:16:46.400 --> 00:16:50.500
- You know that's what it's all about.
- Ash, Alain was really strong.

229
00:16:50.566 --> 00:16:54.633
- Charizard just kept hanging in there.
- Yeah. I wanna keep meeting

230
00:16:54.700 --> 00:16:58.166
more and more trainers and Pokémon, become a lot stronger.

231
00:16:58.233 --> 00:17:00.933
That's just what I'm gonna do. Right, buddy?

232
00:17:01.533 --> 00:17:02.800
Pika!

233
00:17:08.566 --> 00:17:10.700
Both of us grew from that battle.

234
00:17:11.366 --> 00:17:13.300
And Ash made it all possible.

235
00:17:15.099 --> 00:17:18.900
Let's go... and gather a little bit more Mega Evolution energy.

236
00:17:19.633 --> 00:17:20.700
Almost there.

237
00:17:36.400 --> 00:17:38.300
All preparations are complete.

238
00:17:38.366 --> 00:17:39.966
It's time to begin.

239
00:17:57.100 --> 00:17:57.933
Alain?

240
00:17:59.066 --> 00:18:02.600
You've created a strong bond between you and your Pokémon.

241
00:18:02.666 --> 00:18:05.800
As a trainer, you've displayed unparalleled strength

242
00:18:05.866 --> 00:18:09.166
through a number of challenging battles. I applaud you.

243
00:18:09.233 --> 00:18:10.633
Thanks so much, Diantha.

244
00:18:15.500 --> 00:18:16.333
Alain.

245
00:18:17.466 --> 00:18:18.700
Congratulations.

246
00:18:21.566 --> 00:18:23.000
I'm so happy.

247
00:18:23.366 --> 00:18:25.866
Of course these tears are happy tears.

248
00:18:26.166 --> 00:18:28.033
Hey, Lysandre? Don't you--?

249
00:18:29.233 --> 00:18:30.633
Where did Lysandre go?

250
00:18:33.833 --> 00:18:36.100
This is why humans are so...

251
00:18:36.466 --> 00:18:38.233
Are so evil.

252
00:18:42.166 --> 00:18:43.200
Lysandre?

253
00:18:43.266 --> 00:18:46.700
Our research is finally about to produce results.

254
00:18:48.933 --> 00:18:49.800
Zygarde...

255
00:18:50.366 --> 00:18:51.633
the time has come.

256
00:18:51.700 --> 00:18:52.933
Show me your power.

257
00:18:53.000 --> 00:18:53.966
Do it now.

258
00:18:54.033 --> 00:18:56.033
Humans are foolish.

259
00:18:56.100 --> 00:18:57.966
They must disappear.

260
00:18:58.133 --> 00:19:02.266
All the human fools on this planet must disappear!

261
00:19:14.966 --> 00:19:16.066
The curtain's up.

262
00:19:16.666 --> 00:19:19.466
And the spotlight's on my greatest work of all.

263
00:19:44.300 --> 00:19:45.500
What's going on?

264
00:19:47.066 --> 00:19:48.233
Quick! Run!

265
00:19:53.000 --> 00:19:54.133
What's going on?

266
00:19:56.466 --> 00:20:00.466
Anything and everything on this planet is about to be reborn.

267
00:20:01.000 --> 00:20:03.300
Reborn as a beautiful world.

268
00:20:10.266 --> 00:20:13.166
- What is that thing?
- What in the world's going on?

269
00:20:16.766 --> 00:20:17.600
What?

270
00:20:21.666 --> 00:20:24.266
Squishy, stop! Where are you going?

271
00:20:24.333 --> 00:20:26.200
Bonnie! Come back!

272
00:20:27.133 --> 00:20:29.266
The Kalos League has been disrupted

273
00:20:29.333 --> 00:20:32.233
by an unexpected incident of major proportions.

274
00:20:32.633 --> 00:20:34.500
What is Zygarde's power?

275
00:20:34.833 --> 00:20:37.300
And what is Lysandre trying to achieve?

276
00:20:43.366 --> 00:20:45.366
As the journey continues.
